      "lines": [
        "103. 画一条射线，在它的上面标出下列各数：",
        "а) $0,1,5,8,10,17$，取单位线段为1小格；",
        "б) $1,2,4,7,5$，取单位线段为3小格。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "104",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "104. 选定单位线段，在射线上标出下列各数：",
        "а) $1,3,5,7,9,11$；　б) $10,8,6,4,2,0$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "105",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "105. 安德留沙有123张邮票，是阿辽沙的邮票数的3倍。安",
        "德留沙比阿辽沙多多少张邮票？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "106",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "106. 下列天数是一个星期的几分之几？",
        "а) 2昼夜；　б) 3昼夜。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "107",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "107. 一个香瓜重2公斤800克，下列数量香瓜重多少？",
        "а) $\\frac14$个香瓜；　б) $\\frac34$个香瓜。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "108",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "108. 计算：",
        "а) $439\\,060+432\\,288:72$；　б) $2\\,010\\,201-415\\,498:83$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
